            <ArticleTitle>Carcinoma of the parotid gland presenting as facial pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>99-100</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Facial pain is a common reason for patients seeking medical help. A patient is presented who gave a 5-month history of right-sided facial pain, which was subsequently diagnosed as carcinoma of the right parotid gland.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
